REQUEST:
{{ raw_request }}
{% if deck_settings %}

DECK SETTINGS:
- Write for: {{ deck_settings.get('write_for') | join(', ') or 'general audience' }}
- Tone: {{ deck_settings.get('tone') | join(', ') or 'professional' }}
- Theme: {{ deck_settings.get('theme', 'corporate-slate') }}
- Amount of text: {{ deck_settings.get('amount_of_text', 'concise') }} → {{ constraints.get('narrative_guidance', 'data-focused') }}
- Text mode: {{ deck_settings.get('text_mode', 'generate') }}{% if deck_settings.get('text_mode', 'generate') == 'generate' %} (write the wording yourself; figures come only from the request){% endif %}
{% if deck_settings.get('additional_instructions') %}
- Additional instructions: {{ deck_settings['additional_instructions'] }}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if elicitation_answers %}

USER CLARIFICATION ANSWERS:
{% for key, answer in elicitation_answers.items() %}
- {{ key }}: {{ answer }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if supplied_content %}

SUPPLIED CONTENT (use these values VERBATIM in key_messages — do NOT rephrase or drop precision):
```json
{{ supplied_content | tojson(indent=2) }}
```
Content distribution guidance:
- kpi_* keys → key_messages as standalone metrics ("<metric>: <value> (<change>)")
- chart_* keys → key_messages as data series ("<measure> by <period>: <label> <value>, ...")
- table_* keys → key_messages as record sets ("<entity>: <measure> <value>, ... | <entity>: ...")
- bullets → key_messages as qualitative insights
- timeline_items → key_messages as sequential events
- flow_steps → key_messages as process steps
- title/subtitle → first slide's key_messages
{% endif %}

TARGET DECK SIZE: {{ target_slides }} slides{% if slide_count_source == 'request' %} (the count the request states){% endif %}.
{% if target_slides and target_slides > 1 %}
{% if slide_count_source == 'settings' %}
Produce AT MOST {{ target_slides }} slides: one per distinct block of content in the request (plus the cover). When the content runs out, stop - fewer slides are better than a slide that repeats a figure or point shown elsewhere.
{% else %}
Produce EXACTLY {{ target_slides }} slides in your outline.
{% endif %}
Do NOT add Q&A, Appendix, Thank You, or Next Steps slides unless the request explicitly asks for them.
{% endif %}

Produce the deck outline. Every slide's key_messages must be specific, carry the request's figures exactly as written, and carry semantic intent (the downstream planner reads the shape of each message to choose components). Never make up a figure.
